# Integrations Guide

## 1. Purpose

This document describes how to plan, configure, implement, test, and maintain integrations for the Sales Prediction Dashboard / AI-Powered Sales Intelligence SaaS Platform.

The goal is to connect application components and approved external services without compromising security, reliability, data quality, or maintainability.

**Implementation status:** The integrations described here are recommendations until verified against the actual repository and deployment environment.

---

## 2. Integration Principles

Every integration must follow these principles:

- Reuse existing application services wherever possible.
- Keep credentials outside source code.
- Validate all incoming data.
- Apply authentication and authorization to protected operations.
- Handle network errors and service timeouts safely.
- Avoid exposing confidential business data.
- Document configuration and dependencies.
- Test success cases and failure cases.
- Do not report an integration as active until it has been verified.

---

